  "statement": "# Arc Wing — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nFly through authored projectile and obstacle patterns, read safe openings, use direct movement or fire, and survive to a climactic finish.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded 2D flight or shoot-em-up run with staged escalation, readable hazards, damage/failure, recovery or retry, and final victory.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may design patterns, stage structure, combat tuning, boss or climax, and background composition.\n"
}
